gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: monospace; font-size: 0px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;%3CmxGraphModel%3E%3Croot%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%222%22%20parent%3D%221%22%20style%3D%22text%3Bhtml%3D1%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3BstrokeColor%3Dnone%3BfillColor%3Dnone%3Balign%3Dcenter%3BverticalAlign%3Dmiddle%3Brounded%3D0%3B%22%20value%3D%22%26lt%3Bfont%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2014px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bu%26gt%3BAlternative%20Webhook%26lt%3B%2Fu%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Ffont%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bfont%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2014px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bu%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3BPattern%26lt%3B%2Fu%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Ffont%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20height%3D%2230%22%20width%3D%22160%22%20x%3D%22650%22%20y%3D%22-24%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%223%22%20parent%3D%221%22%20style%3D%22text%3Bhtml%3D1%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3BstrokeColor%3Dnone%3BfillColor%3Dnone%3Balign%3Dleft%3BverticalAlign%3Dmiddle%3Brounded%3D0%3B%22%20value%3D%22Instead%20of%20polling%20the%20External%20API%20it%20may%20have%20the%20ability%20to%20POST%20(push)%20the%20data%20back%20to%20and%20Endpoint%20exposes%20by%20a%20ParkingEye%20service%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20height%3D%22100%22%20width%3D%22160%22%20x%3D%22660%22%20y%3D%222%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3C%2Froot%3E%3C%2FmxGraphModel%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;COMPLETE &amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&